--- This file defines the transient object class.  Other storage files import it,
--- so it stays loaded even when the transient object APIs are left out.

--- This module defines TransObj class, modeling the transient object of the G.P. documentation.

--- @kind state
--- @feature transient
omod TRANSIENT-OBJECT is
  pr OBJECT-ID .
  pr TRUSTED-STORAGE-OBJECT .

--- The transient object class.  Initialization state is owned by the transient object;
--- its object handle contains only the shared oid, flags, and position.
  class TransObj | initialized : Bool .
  subclass TransObj < CryptoObj .
endom
